{"diagnosis": "Loopback send 0xa5 timed out with TRAP: uart timeout, no byte received instead of a received byte. Expected send_bitcnt 10->0 over 10 bit-times, but picosoc/simpleuart.v:132 does send_bitcnt <= send_bitcnt - 2, so only 5 shifts occur and ser_tx never completes start+8data+stop. The truncated frame means the receiver never completes, matching the timeout and FAIL 0xdead.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picosoc/simpleuart.v b/picosoc/simpleuart.v
--- a/picosoc/simpleuart.v
+++ b/picosoc/simpleuart.v
@@ -130,4 +130,4 @@
 			if (send_divcnt > cfg_divider && send_bitcnt) begin
 				send_pattern <= {1'b1, send_pattern[9:1]};
-				send_bitcnt <= send_bitcnt - 2;
+				send_bitcnt <= send_bitcnt - 1;
 				send_divcnt <= 0;
", "expected": "tohost PASS, uart loopback byte 0xa5 received with no timeout"}

